---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: onlyLegion AND whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotCanceled AND whenRefundPeriodIsOver AND whenCancelLocked
    q_guard --> q_revert_lock: cancelLocked == false
    q_revert_lock --> [*]: revert LegionSale__CancelNotLocked()
    q_guard --> q_verify_privkey: guards pass
    q_verify_privkey --> q_revert_already: privateKey != 0
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert LegionSale__PrivateKeyAlreadyPublished()
    q_verify_privkey --> q_check_key_match: privateKey == 0
    q_check_key_match --> q_revert_mismatch: calcPubKey(G, privateKey) != publicKey
    q_revert_mismatch --> [*]: revert LegionSale__InvalidBidPrivateKey()
    q_check_key_match --> q_verify_publish: keys match
    q_verify_publish --> q_set_results: _verifyCanPublishSaleResults()
    q_set_results --> q_set_privkey: claimTokensMerkleRoot = claimMerkleRoot; acceptedMerkleRoot = acceptedMerkleRoot; totalTokensAllocated = tokensAllocated; totalCapitalRaised = capitalRaised
    q_set_privkey --> q_emit: privateKey = sealedBidPrivateKey; fixedSalt = fixedSalt
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleResultsPublished(...)

    note right of q_check_key_match
        INV-001: private key must correspond to the sale public key via ECIES.calcPubKey
        INV-002: private key can only be published once
        INV-003: cancel must be locked before results can be published (two-step process)
        INV-004: initializePublishSaleResults must be called first to lock cancel
    end note
